      "title": "URL query rendered as raw HTML",
      "description": "The heading injects the q search parameter into dangerouslySetInnerHTML without escaping or sanitizing it. An attacker can send a crafted /search?q= link that runs script in the victim's session. This is reflected XSS. Render the query as a normal JSX text child so React escapes it.",
      "suggested_change": "      <h1>Results for {query}</h1>",
      "source": "lens:react-dangerously-set-inner-html",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "The heading injects the q search parameter into dangerouslySetInnerHTML without escaping or sanitizing it.",
      "consequence": "An attacker can send a crafted /search?q= link that runs script in the victim's session. This is reflected XSS.",
      "fix": "Render the query as a normal JSX text child so React escapes it."
    },
