      "file_path": "app/search/page.tsx",
      "line_number": 15,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Effect without dependencies refetches forever",
      "description": "The useEffect has no dependency array, so it runs after every render. Each run calls setResults with a new array, which triggers another render. The page sends search requests to /api/products in an endless loop. This loads the API and the browser. Pass [query] as the dependency array so the effect runs only when the query changes.",
      "suggested_change": "  useEffect(() => {\n    searchProducts(query).then(setResults);\n  }, [query]);",
      "source": "oxlint:react-hooks/exhaustive-deps",
      "candidate": "c1",
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "The useEffect has no dependency array, so it runs after every render. Each run calls setResults with a new array, which triggers another render.",
      "consequence": "The page sends search requests to /api/products in an endless loop. This loads the API and the browser.",
      "fix": "Pass [query] as the dependency array so the effect runs only when the query changes."
    },
    {
      "origin": "agent",
      "severity": "major",
      "category": "bug",
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "file_path": "app/search/page.tsx",
      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 13,
      "title": "Hooks called after a conditional return",
      "description": "SearchPage returns early when q is missing, before it calls useState and useEffect. The hook count then differs between renders. React throws a rendered-more-hooks error when q changes from empty to set on the same mounted page. The search page crashes. Call useState and useEffect before the early return. Skip the fetch inside the effect when query is empty.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "SearchPage returns early when q is missing, before it calls useState and useEffect. The hook count then differs between renders.",
      "consequence": "React throws a rendered-more-hooks error when q changes from empty to set on the same mounted page. The search page crashes.",
      "fix": "Call useState and useEffect before the early return. Skip the fetch inside the effect when query is empty."
    },
