      "title": "Search failure is never handled",
      "description": "searchProducts throws when the response is not ok, and the effect attaches no catch handler. The rejected promise floats. A failed search causes an unhandled rejection. The user sees an empty list with no error message. Add a catch handler that stores an error state and renders a message.",
